# Production Environment Variables Template

# Copy this file and set actual values for production deployment

# Backend Environment Variables (Railway/Render/etc.)
MONGO_URL=mongodb://your-mongo-connection-string
SECRET_KEY=generate-a-strong-random-secret-key-here
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-site.netlify.app,https://your-custom-domain.com

# Frontend Environment Variables (Netlify/Vercel)
VITE_REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=https://your-backend-url.railway.app

# Notes:
# - MONGO_URL: Get from your database provider (Railway/Render provides this)
# - SECRET_KEY: Generate with: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
# - ALLOWED_ORIGINS: Comma-separated list of allowed frontend URLs (no spaces)
# - VITE_REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL: Your deployed backend URL
